      "content": "Measurement runs before execution validation, but this conversion throws for a malformed `economicTime` (for example, `not-a-time`). The mutation guard converts that RangeError into `StorageFailure`, so invalid trader input is reported as an infrastructure failure rather than a field-level rejection. Validate timestamps before calling `measureSale` and return an `economicTime` issue for an invalid instant; add a reducing-execution regression test.",
