      "path": "src/coordinators/trade-workflows/sale-measure.ts",
      "content": "The Action history snapshot used to waive the departure reason is discarded. If an Exit with a reason is read here and another client changes it to Hold before `journal.prepareEffects` runs, preparation captures the newer journal revision and the commit succeeds using the stale Exit exemption. Carry the history's `journalRevision` into the commit checks (or verify it matches the prepared reflection snapshot and retry on mismatch), so a sale cannot be recorded without a reason based on an Action that has already changed.",
      "existing_code": "  const { actions } = await deps.journal.queryActionHistory({ tradeId: analysis.tradeId });",
      "start_line": 73,
